      "derivation": "a: 2^2=4, so 2. b: 3^(-2)=1/9, so -2. c: 10^(-2)=0.01, so -2. d: (sqrt(2))^x=2^(x/2)=2^3, so x=6. e: (1/5)^x=5^(-x)=5^2, so x=-2. f: 16^x=2^(4x)=2^(-1), so x=-1/4. g: (1/sqrt(3))^x=3^(-x/2)=3^3, so x=-6. h: 0.4=2/5 and 6.25=25/4=(5/2)^2=(2/5)^(-2), so x=-2.",
